          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can complete beginners use these kits with no craft experience?",
            "answer": "That's exactly who they're made for. Zero experience needed — just follow the box, step by step, and you'll end up..."
          }
        },
        "faq_ediE4n": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do kids need adult supervision to use these kits?",
            "answer": "Depends on the age and kit — younger kids do best with a parent nearby, older kids (and adults) can usually go solo. Every kit is age-labeled so you know exactly what level of hands-on help is needed."
          }
        },
        "q1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are fun DIY activities to do with friends?",
            "answer": "Skip the usual café hangout — make something together instead. Candle making, hand casting, and terrazzo art kits turn a regular friends' evening into an actual memory, minus the pressure of \"being creative.\" Everyone gets a kit, everyone walks away with something they made. Zero skill needed, maximum aesthetic payoff."
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are candle making kits just for adults, or can kids do them too?",
            "answer": "Adults, honestly, might enjoy them more. There's something about pouring wax and picking scents that scratches a very specific \"I did something with my hands today\" itch. Creste's candle kits aren't dumbed down — they're just designed to be doable by anyone, which turns out to be exactly what stressed-out adults want too."
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are good DIY activity ideas for a family get-together?",
            "answer": "The kind of activity where the 6-year-old and the grandparent can both join in and both end up proud of what they made — that's the goal. Hand casting works beautifully for this (multi-generational hand imprints, need we say more), and craft or candle stations let everyone pick their own pace. No one's left out, no one's bored."
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are Creste DIY kits safe to use?",
            "answer": "Yes — every kit is made with safe, skin-friendly materials and designed to be worry-free for the age group it's meant for. No sharp surprises, no guesswork — just open the box and start creating."
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the instructions easy to follow?",
            "answer": "Ridiculously easy. Every kit comes with simple, step-by-step instructions made for absolute beginners — no craft experience, no YouTube tutorials, no stress. If you can follow a recipe, you can follow this."
          }
        },
        "faq_kjxDHV": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does the kit include everything I need, or do I have to buy extra stuff?",
            "answer": "Everything's in the box — literally. Materials, tools, and instructions are all packed together, so there's no last-minute dash to buy glue, wax, or that one missing ingredient. Open it, and you're ready to go."
          }
        }
